      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Content demo\n\nA Content node holds one piece of material, and **its kind** says what sort. Below is every kind it supports, and the cases around them.\n\n1. Switch to **edit mode** (the pencil).\n2. Select a card: an **Edit** button appears on it. Double-clicking works too.\n3. Change the text, or switch the kind in the menu, and watch the card follow.\n4. **Done** or **Esc** puts the card back."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "content-demo",
          "nodeId": "content-demo-landing"
        }
      }
    },
